    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<div class=\"control-header\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor db\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized\">\n<div class=\"umb-rte-editor-con\">\n<p><strong>If your work relies on asphalt testing, this comprehensive guide is for you.</strong></p>\n<p>In this guide, we’ll walk you through the full asphalt testing process — from sampling to strength analysis — so you know exactly what to expect and how testing ensures your project’s success.<br><br></p>\n<p><em>On-Site Sampling&nbsp; |&nbsp; Binder Content&nbsp; |&nbsp; Bulk Density&nbsp; |&nbsp; Marshall Stability&nbsp; |&nbsp; Marshall Flow&nbsp; |&nbsp; Gyratory Compaction&nbsp; |&nbsp; Softening Point&nbsp; |&nbsp; Elastic Recovery&nbsp; |&nbsp; Bitumen Viscosity&nbsp; |&nbsp; MMLS&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
